- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on commit `c8b8ab7878` passed.\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101. I did not merge it. Merging into main needs code-owner approval under policy.\n\nThe repo is a Python project (`requirements.txt`, `src/money.py`) and fastjson is normally a Java library. The pin is in this repo, so I upgraded it, but someone should confirm it is the right dependency for this service.", "type": "text"}]}]}